stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Disconnected
    Connected --> Disconnected: Uplink Failure / Join Timeout
    Disconnected --> Connected: Join Success

    note right of Connected
      Uplink immediately
      Process downlinks
      RTC sync available
    end note

    note right of Disconnected
      Queue events in EEPROM
      1-hour rejoin timer
      Local RTC only
      Flush queue on reconnect
    end note
